<a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/apple-invites/id6472498645">Apple Invites</a> was updated today with two minor features related to RSVPing to an invite: hosts and guests can now react with emoji when someone replies to an event, and a confetti animation now appears when guests reply.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/02/General-Apple-Invites-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-988154" /><br/>
Version 1.10 of the app also contains bug fixes and performance improvements, according to Apple. The update is available now in the App Store.<br/>
<br/>
